  "description": "<p>The version of JQuery used by the HTML UI (1.9.1) has a cross-site scripting vulnerability:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2016-7103\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2016-7103</a>.  The fix is to upgrade to  1.12.0 or later.</p>\n\n<p>This was flagged by our institution's vulnerability detector, but it looks like the actual risk is minimal, and that it is a technicality.</p>",
